<div style="font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:220%; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:3px; color:#d8ca72; text-align:center; margin-bottom:10px;">CHARACTER CLASSES</div>

<div style="font-size:110%; line-height:1.6; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;">
There are '''sixteen total classes''' in EverQuest Legends. Each class belongs to one of four archetypes: '''casters''', '''priests''', '''melee''', and '''hybrids'''.
</div>

<div style="font-size:105%; line-height:1.6; max-width:900px; margin:10px auto 0 auto; text-align:center; color:#d6d6c0;">
There are no experience penalties for any specific class. EverQuest Legends also allows players to mix classes, creating custom class combinations and trio builds.
</div>
