<!-- ARCHETYPES USING GRID SYSTEM -->
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-rows: 1fr auto; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 8em), 1fr)); grid-gap: 0.7rem;">

<!-- CASTERS -->
<div style="grid-column: auto / span 3; border: 1px solid #4b4a2f; background: #10151d; padding: 0 1rem 1rem; color: #d6d6c0;">
<h2>CASTERS</h2>
<p>Casters specialize in spell damage, control, pets, utility, mana tools, and magical burst.</p>
<ul style="margin: 0;">
<li>[[Enchanter|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Enchanter</span>]] (ENC)</li>
<li>[[Magician|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Magician</span>]] (MAG)</li>
<li>[[Necromancer|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Necromancer</span>]] (NEC)</li>
<li>[[Wizard|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Wizard</span>]] (WIZ)</li>
</ul>
</div>

<!-- PRIESTS -->
<div style="grid-column: auto / span 3; border: 1px solid #4b4a2f; background: #10151d; padding: 0 1rem 1rem; color: #d6d6c0;">
<h2>PRIESTS</h2>
<p>Priests provide healing, buffs, debuffs, recovery tools, utility, and group support.</p>
<ul style="margin: 0;">
<li>[[Cleric|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Cleric</span>]] (CLR)</li>
<li>[[Druid|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Druid</span>]] (DRU)</li>
<li>[[Shaman|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Shaman</span>]] (SHM)</li>
</ul>
</div>

<!-- MELEE -->
<div style="grid-column: auto / span 3; border: 1px solid #4b4a2f; background: #10151d; padding: 0 1rem 1rem; color: #d6d6c0;">
<h2>MELEE</h2>
<p>Melee classes focus on weapon-based combat, sustained damage, pulling, disciplines, positioning, and direct physical pressure.</p>
<ul style="margin: 0;">
<li>[[Berserker|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Berserker</span>]] (BER)</li>
<li>[[Monk|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Monk</span>]] (MNK)</li>
<li>[[Rogue|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Rogue</span>]] (ROG)</li>
<li>[[Warrior|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Warrior</span>]] (WAR)</li>
</ul>
</div>

<!-- HYBRIDS -->
<div style="grid-column: auto / span 3; border: 1px solid #4b4a2f; background: #10151d; padding: 0 1rem 1rem; color: #d6d6c0;">
<h2>HYBRIDS</h2>
<p>Hybrids blend martial combat with magic, songs, pets, utility, tanking tools, tracking, and specialized group support.</p>
<ul style="margin: 0;">
<li>[[Bard|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Bard</span>]] (BRD)</li>
<li>[[Beastlord|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Beastlord</span>]] (BST)</li>
<li>[[Paladin|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Paladin</span>]] (PAL)</li>
<li>[[Ranger|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Ranger</span>]] (RNG)</li>
<li>[[Shadow Knight|<span style="color:#b9c8ff;">Shadow Knight</span>]] (SHD)</li>
</ul>
</div>

</div>
<!-- END ARCHETYPES USING GRID SYSTEM -->

